agement-reqs/skill-refactor/fix-to-review-skills.md` |\n| 修改 | `doc/otherDoc/2026-05-27/requirement-queue.md` |\n\n## 验证\n\n```bash\nbash claude_tap_plus/tests/shell/b6_2_skill_integration_test.sh                        # 无后端\nbash claude_tap_plus/tests/shell/b6_2_skill_integration_test.sh http://127.0.0.1:18080  # 有后端\n```\n","numLines":54,"startLine":1,"totalLines":54}},"tool_use_id":"call_706b1391f10d4df9bd92b2eb","duration_ms":4}
