y intercepts requests, forwards to upstream API\n97\t3. For streaming responses, `SSEReassembler` reassembles SSE chunks into a complete response object\n98\t4. Each request/response pair is recorded as one JSONL line via `TraceWriter`\n99\t5. On exit, a usage summary is printed (API calls, token counts by category)\n100\t"}]}
