[2026-05-30 14:55:42] [INFO] [SubagentStop] Input: {"session_id":"b63b113f-845a-45c4-bb3d-eca702572f62","transcript_path":"C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.claude\\projects\\D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\\b63b113f-845a-45c4-bb3d-eca702572f62.jsonl","cwd":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk","permission_mode":"auto","agent_id":"a500bc0bd925f53d4","agent_type":"Explore","hook_event_name":"SubagentStop","stop_hook_active":false,"agent_transcript_path":"C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.claude\\projects\\D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\\b63b113f-845a-45c4-bb3d-eca702572f62\\subagents\\agent-a500bc0bd925f53d4.jsonl","last_assistant_message":"Based on my exploration of the claude_tap_plus codebase, here are concrete answers to your questions:\n\n## 1. **Logger initialization**\n\n### Proxy Mode (main.go, lines 34-38):\n```go\n// 初始化文件日志器（使用默认 trace 目录）\nlogDir := trace.DefaultTraceDir()\nif err := logger.Init(logDir, false, logger.INFO); err != nil {\n    log.Printf(\"warning: logger init failed: %v\", err)\n}\ndefer logger.Close()\n```\n\nThen later (lines 162-168):\n```go\n// 根据详细程度重新初始化日志器\nif tapVerbose {\n    logger.Init(tapOutputDir, true, logger.DEBUG)\n} else {\n    logger.Init(tapOutputDir, false, logger.INFO)\n}\nlogger.Info(\"main\", \"proxy mode: output_dir=%s verbose=%v\", tapOutputDir, tapVerbose)\n```\n\n### Backend Mode (backend_cmd.go, lines 52-61):\n```go\n// 初始化文件日志器\nlogDir := trace.DefaultTraceDir()\nif cfg.DBPath != \"\" && cfg.DBPath != \"backend.db\" {\n    logDir = filepath.Dir(cfg.DBPath)\n}\nif err := logger.Init(logDir, false, logger.DEBUG); err != nil {\n    log.Printf(\"warning: logger init failed: %v\", err)\n}\ndefer logger.Close()\nlogger.Info(\"backend.cmd\", \"backend starting: host=%s port=%d db=%s\", cfg.Host, cfg.Port, cfg.DBPath)\n```\n\n## 2. **Default trace directory**\n\nFrom `writer.go` line 177-189:\n```go\nfunc DefaultTraceDir() string {\n    home, err := os.UserHomeDir()\n    if err != nil {\n        return \".claude-tap-plus/.traces\"\n    }\n    dir := filepath.Join(home, \".claude-tap-plus\", \".traces\")\n    logger.Debug(\"trace\", \"default trace dir: %s\", dir)\n    return dir\n}\n```\n\n**Default path:** `$HOME/.claude-tap-plus/.traces`\n- On Windows: `C:\\Users\\<username>\\.claude-tap-plus\\.traces`\n- If home directory can't be determined: `.claude-tap-plus/.traces`\n\n## 3. **Log file naming**\n\nFrom `writer.go` line 215-232:\n```go\nfunc NewTracePath(baseDir string) string {\n    project := DetectProjectName()\n    \n    now := time.Now()\n    dateTime := now.Format(\"2006-01-02_150405\")\n    shortID := randomHex(3) // 3 字节 = 6 位十六进制字符\n    filename := fmt.Sprintf(\"%s_%s.jsonl\", dateTime, shortID)\n    \n    path := filepath.Join(baseDir, project, filename)\n    logger.Debug(\"trace\", \"trace path: %s\", path)\n    return path\n}\n```\n\n**Format:** `{baseDir}/{project}/{date}_{time}_{shortID}.jsonl`\n- Project name detected from git remote or directory name\n- Date/time format: `YYYY-MM-DD_HHMMSS`\n- Random 6-character hex ID for uniqueness\n\n## 4. **Log format**\n\nFrom `logger.go` line 147-149:\n```go\n// 格式化日志行：15:04:05.000 [LEVEL] module: message\nts := time.Now().Format(\"15:04:05.000\")\nmsg := fmt.Sprintf(format, args...)\nline := fmt.Sprintf(\"%s [%s] %s: %s\\n\", ts, levelNames[level], module, msg)\n```\n\n**Log line format:** `HH:MM:SS.mmm [LEVEL] module: message`\n\n**Log levels:**\n- `DEBUG` (level 0)\n- `INFO`  (level 1)  \n- `WARN`  (level 2)\n- `ERROR` (level 3)\n\nLogger writes to date-based files: `YYYY-MM-DD.log`\n\n## 5. **Verbose flag**\n\nFrom `main.go` lines 143-144 and 162-168:\n```go\ncase arg == \"--tap-verbose\":\n    tapVerbose = true\n\n// 根据详细程度重新初始化日志器\nif tapVerbose {\n    logger.Init(tapOutputDir, true, logger.DEBUG)\n} else {\n    logger.Init(tapOutputDir, false, logger.INFO)\n}\n```\n\n**Effect:**\n- `--tap-verbose` enables DEBUG level logging (INFO by default)\n- Enables console output to stderr for INFO and above messages\n- All log levels go to file regardless\n\n## 6. **Command examples**\n\nFrom README.md and code analysis:\n\n### Build:\n```bash\ncd claude_tap_plus\ngo build -o claude-tap-plus ./cmd/claude-tap\n```\n\n### Proxy Mode (default):\n```bash\n# Basic usage\nclaude-tap-plus claude\n\n# With options\nclaude-tap-plus \\\n  --tap-target=https://api.anthropic.com \\\n  --tap-port=8080 \\\n  --tap-output-dir=.traces \\\n  --tap-verbose \\\n  claude\n```\n\n### Backend Mode:\n```bash\nclaude-tap-plus backend --port=8080 --db=./backend.db\n```\n\n**Backend flags:**\n- `--port` / `-p`: Port to listen on (default random)\n- `--db` / `-d`: Database file path (default backend.db)\n- `--host`: Host binding (default localhost)\n\n### Session Commands:\n```bash\nclaude-tap-plus session-push --all --force\nclaude-tap-plus session-pull --all\nclaude-tap-plus session-status --verbose\n```\n\n### Log files created:\n- **Trace files**: `~/.claude-tap-plus/.traces/{project}/YYYY-MM-DD_HHMMSS_{id}.jsonl`\n- **Log files**: `~/.claude-tap-plus/.traces/YYYY-MM-DD.log` (if using trace dir) or custom directory + `YYYY-MM-DD.log`\n- **Database**: `backend.db` (in backend mode)\n\nAll files are automatically created by the application with appropriate permissions.","background_tasks":[],"session_crons":[]}
