tap-plus 代理 CLI 增强"," "," ## Context"," ","-claude_tap_plus 当前只有约 15 处 `log.Printf` 调用，输出到 stderr，无法持久化排查问题。需要：","-1. 创建 `internal/logger` 包，写日志到按日期分割的文件（如 `.claude-tap-plus/.traces/2026-05-30.log`）","-2. 在 `cmd/`、`internal/` 所有关键文件中添加详细调试日志（函数进出、参数值、中间状态）","-3. 日志目录与 trace 输出目录相同","+代理模式启动后，存在三个问题：","+1. 代理的 stderr 日志会被 Claude Code 子进程捕获并显示在聊天界面中，污染用户交互","+2. 没有命令行入口设置 API key 和 base URL，用户无法方便切换不同供应商/配置","+3. 退出时没有输出 resume 命令，用户无法快速恢复会话"," ","-## 计划","+## 需求拆分"," ","-### Step 1: 新建 `internal/logger/logger.go`","+### 需求 1：控制台日志不泄露到 Claude Code"," ","-纯 stdlib 实现，无外部依赖（叶子包，不 import 其他 internal 包）。","+**问题**：`cmd.Stderr = os.Stderr`（main.go:214）— 代理日志通过 stderr 输出，Claude Code 共享同一 stderr，导致日志出现在聊天界面。"," ","-**API**（包级函数，无需传实例）：","-```go","-func Init(dir string, console bool, level Level) error  // 初始化，创建目录","-func Close() error                                       // 刷新关闭","-func SetLevel(level Level)                               // 运行时调整级别","-func Debug(module, format string, args ...any)           // DEBUG 级别","-func Info(module, format string, args ...any)            // INFO 级别","-func Warn(module, format string, args ...any)            // WARN 级别","-func Error(module, format string, args ...any)           // ERROR 级别","-```","+**方案**：","+- 代理模式：**默认不输出到终端**（`console=false`），只写文件","+- `--tap-verbose` 标志改为：开启 DEBUG 级别 + 写文件，**仍然不输出到终端**","+- 新增 `--tap-console` 标志：额外开启终端输出（用于调试场景）","+- 后端模式：**默认输出到终端**（保持现有行为不变）"," ","-**核心机制**：","-- `sync.Mutex` 保护并发写入 + 日期轮转检查","-- 懒轮转：每次写入时检查日期，变了就关旧文件开新文件","-- 日志格式：`15:04:05.000 [LEVEL] module: message`","-- `console=true` 时双写到 stderr（仅 INFO 及以上）","-- `file==nil`（未 Init）时静默丢弃，不影响测试","+**改动**：","+- `cmd/claude-tap/main.go`：新增 `--tap-console` flag 解析；调整 logger.Init 调用","+  ```","+  默认（无任何标志）：    logger.Init(dir, false, logger.INFO)","+  --tap-verbose：        logger.Init(dir, false, logger.DEBUG)","+  --tap-verbose + --tap-console：logger.Init(dir, true, logger.DEBUG)","+  ```","+- 同时移除 `log.Printf(\"upstream target: ...\")` 和 `log.Printf(\"proxy listening on ...\")` 的 stderr 输出，改用 `logger.Info()` 或直接用 `fmt.Printf()`（stdout 不会被 Claude Code 捕获）"," ","-**日志文件路径**：`{dir}/YYYY-MM-DD.log`","+### 需求 2：多配置文件 profiles.json"," ","-### Step 2: 初始化日志 — `cmd/claude-tap/main.go`","+**配置文件**：`~/.claude-tap-plus/profiles.json`"," ","-在 `main()` 函数顶部，子命令分发前：","-```go","-import \"github.com/liaohch3/claude-tap/claude_tap_plus/internal/logger\"","-","-// main() 中，log.SetFlags 之后","-logDir := trace.DefaultTraceDir()","-logger.Init(logDir, false, logger.INFO)","-defer logger.Close()","-```","-","-在 `runProxy()` 中，解析完 `--tap-output-dir` 后重新初始化：","-```go","-if tapVerbose {","-    logger.Init(tapOutputDir, true, logger.DEBUG)   // verbose: 双写 + DEBUG","-} else {","-    logger.Init(tapOutputDir, false, logger.INFO)    // 正常: 仅文件 + INFO","+**结构**：","+```json","+{","+  \"default\": \"anthropic-main\",","+  \"profiles\": {","+    \"anthropic-main\": {","+      \"base_url\": \"https://api.anthropic.com\",","+      \"api_key\": \"sk-ant-xxxxx\",","+      \"provider\": \"anthropic\"","+    },","+    \"openai-proxy\": {","+      \"base_url\": \"https://my-proxy.com/v1\",","+      \"api_key\": \"sk-xxxxx\",","+      \"provider\": \"openai\"","+    }","+  }"," }"," ```"," ","-在各 session 子命令入口初始化为 INFO 级别。","+**新 CLI 参数**：","+- `--tap-profile NAME` — 选择 profiles.json 中的配置名，读取对应的 base_url 和 api_key","+- `--tap-api-key KEY` — 直接传入 API key（覆盖 profile 中的设置）","+- `--tap-base-url URL` — 直接传入上游地址（覆盖 profile 中的设置，等同现有 `--tap-target`）"," ","-### Step 3: 初始化日志 — `cmd/claude-tap/backend_cmd.go`","+**优先级**（从高到低）：","+1. `--tap-api-key` / `--tap-base-url` 命令行参数","+2. `--tap-profile` 读取 profiles.json 中对应配置","+3. 环境变量 `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` / `ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL`","+4. `~/.claude.json` 配置","+5. 默认值（无 API key，base_url = `https://api.anthropic.com`）"," ","-在 `runBackend()` 中，参数解析后、`NewServer` 前：","+**新增文件**：","+- `internal/profile/profile.go` — 读取和解析 profiles.json","+"," ```go","-logDir := filepath.Dir(cfg.DBPath)  // 或 trace.DefaultTraceDir()","-logger.Init(logDir, false, logger.DEBUG)","-defer logger.Close()","-```","+package profile"," ","-### Step 4: 替换现有 `log.Printf` + 添加新日志点","+type Profile struct {","+    BaseURL  string `json:\"base_url\"`","+    APIKey   string `json:\"api_key\"`","+    Provider string `json:\"provider,omitempty\"`","+}"," ","-按模块分组，每个模块的日志调用模式相同：`logger.Xxx(\"module\", \"message\", args...)`。","+type Config struct {","+    Default  string              `json:\"default\"`","+    Profiles map[string]Profile  `json:\"profiles\"`","+}"," ","-#### `internal/proxy/reverse.go` — module: `\"proxy\"`","+func Load() (*Config, error)           // 读取 ~/.claude-tap-plus/profiles.json","+func (c *Config) Resolve(name string) (*Profile, error)  // 按 name 解析配置","+func ConfigPath() string                // 返回配置文件路径","+```"," ","-替换现有 10 处 `log.Printf`：","-- `log.Printf(\"proxy server error: %v\", err)` → `logger.Error(\"proxy\", ...)`","-- `log.Printf(\"[Turn %d] upstream error: %v\", ...)` → `logger.Warn(\"proxy\", ...)`","-- `log.Printf(\"[Turn %d] trace write error: %v\", ...)` → `logger.Error(\"proxy\", ...)`","-- `log.Printf(\"[Turn %d] ← %d stream done ...\")` → `logger.Info(\"proxy\", ...)`","-- `log.Printf(\"[Turn %d] ← %d (%dms ...\")` → `logger.Info(\"proxy\", ...)`","-- `log.Printf(\"trace-init: failed ...\")` → `logger.Error(\"proxy\", ...)`","-- `log.Printf(\"trace initialized: %s\")` → `logger.Info(\"proxy\", ...)`","-- `log.Printf(\"fallback trace: %v\")` → `logger.Warn(\"proxy\", ...)`","-- `log.Printf(\"using fallback trace: %s\")` → `logger.Warn(\"proxy\", ...)`","+**改动 `main.go`**：","+- 新增 `--tap-profile`, `--tap-api-key` flag 解析","+- 在 `BuildChildEnv()` 后，如有 API key 则注入 `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` 到子进程环境变量","+- 如有 profile 指定的 base_url，覆盖 tapTarget"," ","-新增 DEBUG 点：","-- `NewReverseProxy()` — target, baseDir","-- `Start()` — 监听地址","-- `Stop()` — 停止","-- `serveHTTP()` 入口 — method, path","-- `handleStreaming()` — SSE events 数量","-- `handleNonStreaming()` — 响应大小、解压前后","-- `handleTraceInit()` — session_id, machine_id, slug, trace_path","+**改动 `internal/config/client.go`**：","+- `BuildChildEnv()` 新增可选参数或改为接受额外 env vars，支持注入 `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY`"," ","-#### `internal/trace/writer.go` — module: `\"trace\"`","+### 需求 3（原需求 4）：退出时打印 resume 命令"," ","-- `NewTraceWriter()` — DEBUG: path 创建","-- `Write()` — DEBUG: record 编号、字节数","-- `Close()` — INFO: 总记录数","-- `DefaultTraceDir()` — DEBUG: 返回值","-- `DetectProjectName()` — DEBUG: 项目名","-- `NewTracePath()` — DEBUG: 路径","-- `NewSessionTracePath()` — DEBUG: 路径","+**当前退出摘要**：","+```","+📋 Claude Code exited","+   API calls:      4","+   Input tokens:    0","+   ...","+   Trace: C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.claude-tap-plus\\.traces","+```"," ","-#### `internal/sse/reassembler.go` — module: `\"sse\"`","+**增强为**：","+```","+📋 Claude Code exited","+   API calls:      4","+   Input tokens:    1234","+   Output tokens:   5678","+   Cache read:      0","+   Cache create:    0","+   Trace: C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.claude-tap-plus\\.traces\\claude-hk\\2026-05-30_150924_f9a252.jsonl"," ","-- `FeedBytes()` — DEBUG: chunk 大小（仅首块，避免高频）","-- `addEvent()` — DEBUG: event type（仅 message_start/message_delta/content_block_start 等关键事件）","-- `accumulateChatCompletionChunk()` — DEBUG: 首块初始化、finish_reason","+📎 Resume:","+   claude-tap-plus --tap-verbose claude --resume fbf7e71a-f540-4906-973b-317649cb6431","+```"," ","-#### `internal/backend/server.go` — module: `\"backend\"`","+**需要获取的数据**：","+- 实际 trace 文件路径（从 `TraceWriter` 或 `ReverseProxy` 中获取）","+- session_id（从第一个 API 请求中提取的，或从 trace-init 请求中获取）"," ","-替换 `log.Printf` + 新增：","-- `NewServer()` — DEBUG: config","-- `Start()` — INFO: cleanup 结果、监听地址","-- `Close()` — INFO: 关闭","-- 信号处理 — INFO: shutdown","+**改动**：","+- `internal/proxy/reverse.go`：`ReverseProxy` 新增 `tracePath` 和 `sessionID` 字段，在 `handleTraceInit()` 和 fallback 中记录","+- `internal/proxy/reverse.go`：`Summary()` 返回值增加 `trace_path` 和 `session_id`","+- `cmd/claude-tap/main.go`：退出摘要中增加 trace 文件路径和 resume 命令"," ","-#### `internal/backend/store/sqlite.go` — module: `\"store\"`","+## 涉及文件"," ","-- `NewSQLiteStore()` — DEBUG: 打开、WAL、migrations；INFO: 就绪","-- `Close()` — INFO: 关闭","+| 操作 | 文件 |","+|------|------|","+| 新建 | `internal/profile/profile.go` |","+| 修改 | `cmd/claude-tap/main.go` |","+| 修改 | `internal/proxy/reverse.go` |","+| 修改 | `internal/config/client.go` |"," ","-#### `internal/backend/store/migrations.go` — module: `\"store\"`","+## 验证"," ","-- `runMigrations()` — DEBUG: SQL 摘要","+```bash","+# 1. 构建验证","+cd claude_tap_plus && go build ./... && go test ./..."," ","-#### `internal/backend/store/issue_store.go` — module: `\"store.issue\"`","+# 2. profiles.json 测试","+echo '{\"default\":\"test\",\"profiles\":{\"test\":{\"base_url\":\"https://api.anthropic.com\",\"api_key\":\"sk-test\",\"provider\":\"anthropic\"}}}' > ~/.claude-tap-plus/profiles.json"," ","-- `CheckIssues()` — DEBUG: 入参、结果","-- `ClaimIssue()` — DEBUG: 入参；INFO: 成功；WARN: 冲突","-- `UpdateIssueStatus()` — DEBUG: 入参；WARN: 非所有者","-- `ReleaseIssue()` — DEBUG: 入参；INFO: 结果","-- `ReleaseSessionIssues()` — DEBUG: 入参；INFO: 释放数量","+# 3. 代理模式启动 — 默认不输出到终端","+.\\claude-tap-plus.exe claude","+# 应该看不到 logger 日志在终端"," ","-#### `internal/backend/api/issue_handler.go` — module: `\"api.issue\"`","+# 4. 加 --tap-console 才输出到终端","+.\\claude-tap-plus.exe --tap-verbose --tap-console claude"," ","-- 各 handler — DEBUG: 入参；WARN: 验证错误","+# 5. 用 profile 启动","+.\\claude-tap-plus.exe --tap-profile test claude"," ","-#### `internal/backend/api/session_handler.go` — module: `\"api.session\"`","+# 6. 直接传 API key","+.\\claude-tap-plus.exe --tap-api-key sk-xxx claude"," ","-- `Register()` — DEBUG: session_id；INFO: 成功；WARN: 重复","-- `Close()` — DEBUG: session_id；INFO: 成功","-- `List()`/`Get()` — DEBUG: 过滤条件","-","-#### `internal/backend/api/health_handler.go` — module: `\"api.health\"`","-","-- `Health()` — DEBUG: check","-","-#### `internal/backend/api/router.go` — module: `\"api\"`","-","-- `NewRouter()` — DEBUG: 路由数量","-","-#### `internal/backend/service/*.go` — module: `\"svc.issue\"` / `\"svc.session\"` / `\"svc.cleanup\"`","-","-- 各 service 方法 — DEBUG: 入参；INFO: 关键结果","-- 替换 `cleanup_service.go` 中的 `log.Printf`","-","-#### `internal/backend/config.go` — module: `\"backend.config\"`","-","-- `DefaultConfig()` — DEBUG: 默认值","-","-#### `internal/config/client.go` — module: `\"config\"`","-","-- `DetectTarget()` — DEBUG: env 检查；INFO: 结果","-- `ResolveCmd()` — DEBUG: 结果","-- `BuildChildEnv()` — DEBUG: 环境变量","-","-#### `internal/config/claudeconfig.go` — module: `\"config\"`","-","-- `ReadClaudeConfig()` — DEBUG: 读取路径、结果","-","-#### `internal/session/collect.go` — module: `\"session\"`","-","-- `SessionPush()` — INFO: 参数；DEBUG: 各项目扫描细节","-- `collectProject()` — DEBUG: 文件处理","-","-#### `internal/session/restore.go` — module: `\"session\"`","-","-- `SessionPull()` — INFO: 参数；DEBUG: 各项目细节","-","-#### `internal/session/status.go` — module: `\"session\"`","-","-- `SessionStatus()` — INFO: 存储路径；DEBUG: 各项目","-","-#### `internal/usage/normalize.go` — module: `\"usage\"`","-","-- `NormalizeUsage()` — DEBUG: 输入 keys、输出结果","-","-#### `internal/trace/anthropic.go` — module: `\"trace\"`","-","-- `NewAnthropicTraceRecord()` — DEBUG: turn, method","-","-### Step 5: 编译验证","-","-```bash","-cd claude_tap_plus","-go build ./...","-go test ./...","+# 7. 退出后检查 resume 命令和 trace 路径是否正确打印"," ```","-","-## 涉及文件","-","-| 操作 | 文件 |","-|------|------|","-| **新建** | `internal/logger/logger.go` |","-| **修改** | `cmd/claude-tap/main.go` |","-| **修改** | `cmd/claude-tap/backend_cmd.go` |","-| **修改** | `internal/proxy/reverse.go` |","-| **修改** | `internal/trace/writer.go` |","-| **修改** | `internal/trace/anthropic.go` |","-| **修改** | `internal/sse/reassembler.go` |","-| **修改** | `internal/backend/server.go` |","-| **修改** | `internal/backend/config.go` |","-| **修改** | `internal/backend/store/sqlite.go` |","-| **修改** | `internal/backend/store/migrations.go` |","-| **修改** | `internal/backend/store/issue_store.go` |","-| **修改** | `internal/backend/store/session_store.go` |","-| **修改** | `internal/backend/api/router.go` |","-| **修改** | `internal/backend/api/issue_handler.go` |","-| **修改** | `internal/backend/api/session_handler.go` |","-| **修改** | `internal/backend/api/health_handler.go` |","-| **修改** | `internal/backend/service/issue_service.go` |","-| **修改** | `internal/backend/service/session_service.go` |","-| **修改** | `internal/backend/service/cleanup_service.go` |","-| **修改** | `internal/config/client.go` |","-| **修改** | `internal/config/claudeconfig.go` |","-| **修改** | `internal/session/collect.go` |","-| **修改** | `internal/session/restore.go` |","-| **修改** | `internal/session/status.go` |","-| **修改** | `internal/usage/normalize.go` |","-","-共 **1 个新文件 + 25 个修改文件**，约 140+ 处日志调用。","-","-## 验证","-","-```bash","-cd claude_tap_plus","-go build ./...                           # 编译通过","-go test ./...                            # 测试通过","-go run ./cmd/claude-tap backend --port 18099 &","-# 检查日志文件","-cat ~/.claude-tap-plus/.traces/$(date +%Y-%m-%d).log","-kill %1","-```"]}],"originalFile":"# claude_tap_plus 全局日志系统 — 按日期分割的文件日志\n\n## Context\n\nclaude_tap_plus 当前只有约 15 处 `log.Printf` 调用，输出到 stderr，无法持久化排查问题。需要：\n1. 创建 `internal/logger` 包，写日志到按日期分割的文件（如 `.claude-tap-plus/.traces/2026-05-30.log`）\n2. 在 `cmd/`、`internal/` 所有关键文件中添加详细调试日志（函数进出、参数值、中间状态）\n3. 日志目录与 trace 输出目录相同\n\n## 计划\n\n### Step 1: 新建 `internal/logger/logger.go`\n\n纯 stdlib 实现，无外部依赖（叶子包，不 import 其他 internal 包）。\n\n**API**（包级函数，无需传实例）：\n```go\nfunc Init(dir string, console bool, level Level) error  // 初始化，创建目录\nfunc Close() error                                       // 刷新关闭\nfunc SetLevel(level Level)                               // 运行时调整级别\nfunc Debug(module, format string, args ...any)           // DEBUG 级别\nfunc Info(module, format string, args ...any)            // INFO 级别\nfunc Warn(module, format string, args ...any)            // WARN 级别\nfunc Error(module, format string, args ...any)           // ERROR 级别\n```\n\n**核心机制**：\n- `sync.Mutex` 保护并发写入 + 日期轮转检查\n- 懒轮转：每次写入时检查日期，变了就关旧文件开新文件\n- 日志格式：`15:04:05.000 [LEVEL] module: message`\n- `console=true` 时双写到 stderr（仅 INFO 及以上）\n- `file==nil`（未 Init）时静默丢弃，不影响测试\n\n**日志文件路径**：`{dir}/YYYY-MM-DD.log`\n\n### Step 2: 初始化日志 — `cmd/claude-tap/main.go`\n\n在 `main()` 函数顶部，子命令分发前：\n```go\nimport \"github.com/liaohch3/claude-tap/claude_tap_plus/internal/logger\"\n\n// main() 中，log.SetFlags 之后\nlogDir := trace.DefaultTraceDir()\nlogger.Init(logDir, false, logger.INFO)\ndefer logger.Close()\n```\n\n在 `runProxy()` 中，解析完 `--tap-output-dir` 后重新初始化：\n```go\nif tapVerbose {\n    logger.Init(tapOutputDir, true, logger.DEBUG)   // verbose: 双写 + DEBUG\n} else {\n    logger.Init(tapOutputDir, false, logger.INFO)    // 正常: 仅文件 + INFO\n}\n```\n\n在各 session 子命令入口初始化为 INFO 级别。\n\n### Step 3: 初始化日志 — `cmd/claude-tap/backend_cmd.go`\n\n在 `runBackend()` 中，参数解析后、`NewServer` 前：\n```go\nlogDir := filepath.Dir(cfg.DBPath)  // 或 trace.DefaultTraceDir()\nlogger.Init(logDir, false, logger.DEBUG)\ndefer logger.Close()\n```\n\n### Step 4: 替换现有 `log.Printf` + 添加新日志点\n\n按模块分组，每个模块的日志调用模式相同：`logger.Xxx(\"module\", \"message\", args...)`。\n\n#### `internal/proxy/reverse.go` — module: `\"proxy\"`\n\n替换现有 10 处 `log.Printf`：\n- `log.Printf(\"proxy server error: %v\", err)` → `logger.Error(\"proxy\", ...)`\n- `log.Printf(\"[Turn %d] upstream error: %v\", ...)` → `logger.Warn(\"proxy\", ...)`\n- `log.Printf(\"[Turn %d] trace write error: %v\", ...)` → `logger.Error(\"proxy\", ...)`\n- `log.Printf(\"[Turn %d] ← %d stream done ...\")` → `logger.Info(\"proxy\", ...)`\n- `log.Printf(\"[Turn %d] ← %d (%dms ...\")` → `logger.Info(\"proxy\", ...)`\n- `log.Printf(\"trace-init: failed ...\")` → `logger.Error(\"proxy\", ...)`\n- `log.Printf(\"trace initialized: %s\")` → `logger.Info(\"proxy\", ...)`\n- `log.Printf(\"fallback trace: %v\")` → `logger.Warn(\"proxy\", ...)`\n- `log.Printf(\"using fallback trace: %s\")` → `logger.Warn(\"proxy\", ...)`\n\n新增 DEBUG 点：\n- `NewReverseProxy()` — target, baseDir\n- `Start()` — 监听地址\n- `Stop()` — 停止\n- `serveHTTP()` 入口 — method, path\n- `handleStreaming()` — SSE events 数量\n- `handleNonStreaming()` — 响应大小、解压前后\n- `handleTraceInit()` — session_id, machine_id, slug, trace_path\n\n#### `internal/trace/writer.go` — module: `\"trace\"`\n\n- `NewTraceWriter()` — DEBUG: path 创建\n- `Write()` — DEBUG: record 编号、字节数\n- `Close()` — INFO: 总记录数\n- `DefaultTraceDir()` — DEBUG: 返回值\n- `DetectProjectName()` — DEBUG: 项目名\n- `NewTracePath()` — DEBUG: 路径\n- `NewSessionTracePath()` — DEBUG: 路径\n\n#### `internal/sse/reassembler.go` — module: `\"sse\"`\n\n- `FeedBytes()` — DEBUG: chunk 大小（仅首块，避免高频）\n- `addEvent()` — DEBUG: event type（仅 message_start/message_delta/content_block_start 等关键事件）\n- `accumulateChatCompletionChunk()` — DEBUG: 首块初始化、finish_reason\n\n#### `internal/backend/server.go` — module: `\"backend\"`\n\n替换 `log.Printf` + 新增：\n- `NewServer()` — DEBUG: config\n- `Start()` — INFO: cleanup 结果、监听地址\n- `Close()` — INFO: 关闭\n- 信号处理 — INFO: shutdown\n\n#### `internal/backend/store/sqlite.go` — module: `\"store\"`\n\n- `NewSQLiteStore()` — DEBUG: 打开、WAL、migrations；INFO: 就绪\n- `Close()` — INFO: 关闭\n\n#### `internal/backend/store/migrations.go` — module: `\"store\"`\n\n- `runMigrations()` — DEBUG: SQL 摘要\n\n#### `internal/backend/store/issue_store.go` — module: `\"store.issue\"`\n\n- `CheckIssues()` — DEBUG: 入参、结果\n- `ClaimIssue()` — DEBUG: 入参；INFO: 成功；WARN: 冲突\n- `UpdateIssueStatus()` — DEBUG: 入参；WARN: 非所有者\n- `ReleaseIssue()` — DEBUG: 入参；INFO: 结果\n- `ReleaseSessionIssues()` — DEBUG: 入参；INFO: 释放数量\n\n#### `internal/backend/api/issue_handler.go` — module: `\"api.issue\"`\n\n- 各 handler — DEBUG: 入参；WARN: 验证错误\n\n#### `internal/backend/api/session_handler.go` — module: `\"api.session\"`\n\n- `Register()` — DEBUG: session_id；INFO: 成功；WARN: 重复\n- `Close()` — DEBUG: session_id；INFO: 成功\n- `List()`/`Get()` — DEBUG: 过滤条件\n\n#### `internal/backend/api/health_handler.go` — module: `\"api.health\"`\n\n- `Health()` — DEBUG: check\n\n#### `internal/backend/api/router.go` — module: `\"api\"`\n\n- `NewRouter()` — DEBUG: 路由数量\n\n#### `internal/backend/service/*.go` — module: `\"svc.issue\"` / `\"svc.session\"` / `\"svc.cleanup\"`\n\n- 各 service 方法 — DEBUG: 入参；INFO: 关键结果\n- 替换 `cleanup_service.go` 中的 `log.Printf`\n\n#### `internal/backend/config.go` — module: `\"backend.config\"`\n\n- `DefaultConfig()` — DEBUG: 默认值\n\n#### `internal/config/client.go` — module: `\"config\"`\n\n- `DetectTarget()` — DEBUG: env 检查；INFO: 结果\n- `ResolveCmd()` — DEBUG: 结果\n- `BuildChildEnv()` — DEBUG: 环境变量\n\n#### `internal/config/claudeconfig.go` — module: `\"config\"`\n\n- `ReadClaudeConfig()` — DEBUG: 读取路径、结果\n\n#### `internal/session/collect.go` — module: `\"session\"`\n\n- `SessionPush()` — INFO: 参数；DEBUG: 各项目扫描细节\n- `collectProject()` — DEBUG: 文件处理\n\n#### `internal/session/restore.go` — module: `\"session\"`\n\n- `SessionPull()` — INFO: 参数；DEBUG: 各项目细节\n\n#### `internal/session/status.go` — module: `\"session\"`\n\n- `SessionStatus()` — INFO: 存储路径；DEBUG: 各项目\n\n#### `internal/usage/normalize.go` — module: `\"usage\"`\n\n- `NormalizeUsage()` — DEBUG: 输入 keys、输出结果\n\n#### `internal/trace/anthropic.go` — module: `\"trace\"`\n\n- `NewAnthropicTraceRecord()` — DEBUG: turn, method\n\n### Step 5: 编译验证\n\n```bash\ncd claude_tap_plus\ngo build ./...\ngo test ./...\n```\n\n## 涉及文件\n\n| 操作 | 文件 |\n|------|------|\n| **新建** | `internal/logger/logger.go` |\n| **修改** | `cmd/claude-tap/main.go` |\n| **修改** | `cmd/claude-tap/backend_cmd.go` |\n| **修改** | `internal/proxy/reverse.go` |\n| **修改** | `internal/trace/writer.go` |\n| **修改** | `internal/trace/anthropic.go` |\n| **修改** | `internal/sse/reassembler.go` |\n| **修改** | `internal/backend/server.go` |\n| **修改** | `internal/backend/config.go` |\n| **修改** | `internal/backend/store/sqlite.go` |\n| **修改** | `internal/backend/store/migrations.go` |\n| **修改** | `internal/backend/store/issue_store.go` |\n| **修改** | `internal/backend/store/session_store.go` |\n| **修改** | `internal/backend/api/router.go` |\n| **修改** | `internal/backend/api/issue_handler.go` |\n| **修改** | `internal/backend/api/session_handler.go` |\n| **修改** | `internal/backend/api/health_handler.go` |\n| **修改** | `internal/backend/service/issue_service.go` |\n| **修改** | `internal/backend/service/session_service.go` |\n| **修改** | `internal/backend/service/cleanup_service.go` |\n| **修改** | `internal/config/client.go` |\n| **修改** | `internal/config/claudeconfig.go` |\n| **修改** | `internal/session/collect.go` |\n| **修改** | `internal/session/restore.go` |\n| **修改** | `internal/session/status.go` |\n| **修改** | `internal/usage/normalize.go` |\n\n共 **1 个新文件 + 25 个修改文件**，约 140+ 处日志调用。\n\n## 验证\n\n```bash\ncd claude_tap_plus\ngo build ./...                           # 编译通过\ngo test ./...                            # 测试通过\ngo run ./cmd/claude-tap backend --port 18099 &\n# 检查日志文件\ncat ~/.claude-tap-plus/.traces/$(date +%Y-%m-%d).log\nkill %1\n```\n","userModified":false},"tool_use_id":"call_fd327c446e8f4a979afdc7fd","duration_ms":13}
