ate, t, filename)\n\tlogger.Debug(\"trace\", \"trace path: %s\", path)\n\treturn path\n}"},"tool_use_id":"call_28d34de5e71647ccb26bcfc1","tool_response":"The file D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\claude_tap_plus\\internal\\trace\\writer.go has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]}
