start flow:**\n1. Line 22: Initialize with `backend.DefaultConfig()`\n2. Lines 25-50: Parse command line arguments to override config\n3. Line 52: Initialize logger using `trace.DefaultTraceDir()`\n4. Line 64: Create backend server with config\n5. Line 72: Start server\n\n**Backend config (lines 23-31):**\n```go\nfunc DefaultConfig() Config {\n    cfg := Config{\n        Host:   \"127.0.0.1\",\n        Port:   8080,\n        DBPath: \"backend.db\",\n    }\n    return cfg\n}\n```\n\n**No backend.json writing currently implemented** - the backend writes to SQLite database (`backend.db` by default).\n\n## 5. **Existing JSON file reading/writing utilities**\n\n**Found in these files:**\n- `internal/trace/writer.go`: Uses `json.Marshal` for writing trace records\n- `internal/proxy/reverse.go`: Uses `json.NewDecoder`, `json.Marshal`, `json.Unmarshal`\n- `internal/session/meta.go`: Likely contains JSON utilities for session metadata\n- Various test files show JSON reading patterns\n\n**Common patterns used:**\n```go\n// Writing JSON\njson.Marshal()\nos.WriteFile()\n\n// Reading JSON\njson.Unmarshal()\nos.ReadFile()\njson.NewDecoder(r.Body).Decode(&v)\n```\n\n## 6. **Project's trace base dir structure**\n\n**Actual directory structure found:**\n```\n~/.claude-tap-plus/\n└── .traces/\n    ├── [machine_id]/\n    │   └── [project_slug]/\n    │       └── [session_id].jsonl\n```\n\n**Example files:**\n- `~/.claude-tap-plus/.traces/claude-hk/2026-05-30_150924_f9a252.jsonl`\n\n**Directory path generation:** `DefaultTraceDir()` → returns `$HOME/.claude-tap-plus/.traces`\n\nThe trace files are JSON Lines format (JSONL), with each line representing an API call record. The structure follows machine → project → session hierarchy for organization."}],"totalDurationMs":97265,"totalTokens":69587,"totalToolUseCount":21,"usage":{"input_tokens":83,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":67528,"output_tokens":1976,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_request