e flags (--tap-*, --port, --db, etc.)\n- SQLite database (backend.db)\n- Any other config/settings\n\nFor each config, report: path/format, purpose, who reads, who writes, is it still used or orphaned.\n\nSearch thoroughly in:\n- claude_tap_plus/cmd/claude-tap/\n- claude_tap_plus/internal/backend/\n- claude_tap_plus/internal/config/\n- .claude/\n- .claude/hooks/\n- .claude/skills/","subagent_type":"Explore"},"tool_use_id":"call_9ab6a5adb5ab48f18abd26eb"}
